# Recorded output of eval and benchmark runs. These files capture the state of
# one run on one machine (absolute checkout paths included), so they are
# generated, not hand-written: `aethyme quality inspect` skips them unless
# `--include-generated` is passed, and GitHub collapses them in diffs.
packages/aethyme-eval/*/results/** linguist-generated
packages/aethyme-eval/benchmarks/*/results/** linguist-generated
